Inclusion Criteria:

Eligible transgender adults must:

1. be 18 years of age or older;
2. speak primarily English;
3. live in the U.S.;
4. have a gender identity different from their assumed gender, or sex assigned, at birth;
5. identify as a person of transgender experience;
6. endorse having experienced two or more problem(s) related to alcohol or other drug use within the past 12 months.
